<section image-layout="blank" id="zZB1kjz0C4"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="7eYzNhFwdR"><p role="eyebrow">One field · five control points</p><h2>Efficiency is won before, during and after the pass</h2><p font-size="lg">Each stage produces a decision or record that prevents a different source of lost time or poor work quality.</p><grid marker="number" marker-rule="true" marker-position="above" marker-align="start" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-gap:0.6em"><grid-item id="frX5rY5EuR" colspan="12"><h3>Plan</h3><p>Map field shape, access and the work window. Produce a route sketch.</p><labels><label variant="outline">TURN LOSS</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="7AEiIhFq-w" colspan="12"><h3>Select</h3><p>Match implement, power and expected annual use.</p><labels><label variant="outline">SYSTEM MISMATCH</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="DrRZP5_LM-" colspan="12"><h3>Set up</h3><p>Calibrate width, depth, pressure and input delivery.</p><labels><label variant="outline">OVERLAP + MISSES</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="W0aAKJZsGO" colspan="12"><h3>Operate</h3><p>Record speed, turns, refill time and stoppages.</p><labels><label variant="outline">WAITING LOSS</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="chZDKDkLY6" colspan="12"><h3>Verify</h3><p>Inspect quality, log the result and correct the next run.</p><labels><label variant="outline">REPEAT LOSS</label></labels></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item background-color="accent" padding="14pt 18pt"><h3>Field efficiency is not a machine specification—it is the cumulative result of these five controls.</h3></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>